  "content_html": "<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiUpbStNP-TxUBUP6xQTwKo10gJoMMF9x2EexFx37Qnbeg2mrbcXCAdURGifEkjS-IM1oM01w4bfqt9aukMGZ1-kkNqdObrworXibAH9SVs6X0dcfyAGSXQndplhg6pknRax8zHd5iTf56BPaNaXmTvEIx7WOkAsypjjxB83Tm1LCvfVFYpypPYd_F4XYo/s291/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.PNG\" style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Cairo, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 1em; outline: none; padding: 0px; transition: all; vertical-align: baseline;\"><img alt=\"רישום של ילד עם כובע מצחייה\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"291\" data-original-width=\"219\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiUpbStNP-TxUBUP6xQTwKo10gJoMMF9x2EexFx37Qnbeg2mrbcXCAdURGifEkjS-IM1oM01w4bfqt9aukMGZ1-kkNqdObrworXibAH9SVs6X0dcfyAGSXQndplhg6pknRax8zHd5iTf56BPaNaXmTvEIx7WOkAsypjjxB83Tm1LCvfVFYpypPYd_F4XYo/s16000/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.PNG\" style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; height: auto; margin: 0px; max-width: 100%; outline: none; padding: 0px; position: relative; text-decoration-line: none; vertical-align: baseline;\" /></a></p><h2 style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.3em; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">🎈 שִׂיחָה בְּסְמָלִים – \"הַבַּיִת שֶׁמְּבַקֵּשׁ בְּדִיקָה\"</span></span></h2><p data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"358\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🧱 <b>הַקִּיר</b> (מְדַבֵּר בְּשֶׁקֶט):<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֲנִי לֹא צוֹעֵק וְלֹא נוֹפֵל.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֲבָל הוֹפִיעַ עָלַי מַשֶּׁהוּ מְשֻׁנֶּה.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">סִימָן קָטָן שֶׁאוֹמֵר&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">שִׂימוּ לֵב.</span></span></p><p data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"358\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🟢🟥 <b>הַכֶּתֶם שֶׁבַּקִּיר</b> (מְבֻלְבָּל):<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֲנִי לֹא יוֹדֵעַ אִם אֲנִי בְּעָיָה.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לִפְעָמִים אֲנִי רַק צֶבַע.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְלִפְעָמִים אֲנִי סִימָן שֶׁצָּרִיךְ בְּדִיקָה.</span></span></p><p data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"358\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🧒 <b>הַיֶּלֶד</b> (שׁוֹאֵל):<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אָז מָה עוֹשִׂים כְּשֶׁזֶּה קוֹרֶה לַבַּיִת?</span></span></p><p data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"358\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">👀 <b>הַכֹּהֵן הַבּוֹדֵק</b> (מִתְבּוֹנֵן):<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לֹא שׁוֹבְרִים מִיָּד.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְלֹא מִתְעַלְּמִים.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">קֹדֶם מִסְתַּכְּלִים,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בּוֹדְקִים לְפִי הַכְּלָלִים שֶׁל הַתּוֹרָה.</span></span></p><p data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"358\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">📦 <b>הַחֲפָצִים&nbsp;בַּבַּיִת</b> (מִתְלַחְשְׁשִׁים):<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לִפְנֵי הַבְּדִיקָה&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">מוֹצִיאִים אוֹתָנוּ הַחוּצָה.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">כְּדֵי שֶׁלֹּא נִטְמָא&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">סְתָם.</span></span></p><p data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"358\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">🚪 <b>הַבַּיִת</b> (נִסְגַּר בַּעֲדִינוּת):</span></p><p data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"358\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">עַכְשָׁו אֲנִי בְּהֶסְגֵּר.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לֹא כְּעֹנֶשׁ.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">רַק הַפְסָקָה קְצָרָה.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">זְמַן לִבְדֹּק מָה קוֹרֶה לִי.</span></span></p><p data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"358\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">⏳ <b>הַזְּמַן</b> (סוֹפֵר לְאַט):<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">מְחַכִּים כַּמָּה יָמִים.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">רוֹאִים:<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">הַאִם הַכֶּתֶם נֶעֱלַם,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">נִשְׁאַר,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אוֹ מִתְפַּשֵּׁט.</span></span></p><p data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"358\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">👀 <b>הַכֹּהֵן</b> (חוֹזֵר לִבְדֹּק):<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אִם הַכֶּתֶם עָבַר –&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">הַבַּיִת חוֹזֵר לְשִׁגְרָה.</span></span></p><p data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"358\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🟢 <b>הַבַּיִת</b> (נוֹשֵׁם לִרְוָחָה):<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֶפְשָׁר לְהַמְשִׁיךְ לָגוּר בִּי.</span></span></p><p data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"358\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🧱 <b>הָאֶבֶן הַנְּגוּעָה</b> (מְדַבֶּרֶת בְּרֹגַע):<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְלִפְעָמִים צָרִיךְ לְהוֹצִיא אוֹתִי.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לֹא אֶת כָּל הַבַּיִת –&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">רַק אֶת הַחֵלֶק הַבְּעָיָתִי.</span></span></p><p data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"358\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🧒 <b>הַיֶּלֶד</b> (שׁוֹאֵל בִּזְהִירוּת):<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וּמָה אִם זֶה לֹא עוֹזֵר?</span></span></p><p data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"358\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">👀 <b>הַכֹּהֵן</b> (בִּרְצִינוּת שְׁקֵטָה):<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">רַק אִם שׁוּם דָּבָר לֹא עוֹזֵר –<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אָז הוֹרְסִים אֶת הַבַּיִת.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֲבָל זֶה מַמָּשׁ הַסּוֹף.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לִפְנֵי זֶה מְנַסִּים הַכֹּל.</span></span></p><p data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"358\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">✨ <b>סִיּוּם</b>:<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">כְּשֶׁמַּשֶּׁהוּ נִרְאֶה לֹא טוֹב –<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לֹא מִתְעַלְּמִים,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְלֹא שׁוֹבְרִים מִיָּד.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בּוֹדְקִים, מְתַקְּנִים,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְנוֹתְנִים הִזְדַּמְּנוּת.</span></span></p><div style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Cairo, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><h2 style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.3em; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">תפזורת מילים</span></span></h2></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">מצאו את 🔍 המילים מהפרשה: אֶרֶז, תוֹלַעַת, חֶרֶשׂ, מַיִם, תְּנוּךְ, אֹזֶן, לֹג, יוֹנָה, אָשָׁם, בֹּהֶן, רֹאשׁ, קֹדֶשׁ.<br /></span><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">בכיוונים ⬅️ ➡️ ⬇️ ⬆️</span></span><br /><div style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: right;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhctj0V6CetiMo1br7T9C54HlM55sCB9OJmdSASa-CSR7wg0R_rIi5rox7Sqd3I-MklI22VuLmvB4F9VVipMJHZKsyHN5BP0IFiSP1R8hCZMqKVZryt8J2MCGmXoK9tEsvJx5rPwIFMb-_jF31Fh2hh6Afdz63TrZVQiYlsPhY7FqYp26Hfxpx9cIQlMDM/s466/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.PNG\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"457\" data-original-width=\"466\" height=\"314\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhctj0V6CetiMo1br7T9C54HlM55sCB9OJmdSASa-CSR7wg0R_rIi5rox7Sqd3I-MklI22VuLmvB4F9VVipMJHZKsyHN5BP0IFiSP1R8hCZMqKVZryt8J2MCGmXoK9tEsvJx5rPwIFMb-_jF31Fh2hh6Afdz63TrZVQiYlsPhY7FqYp26Hfxpx9cIQlMDM/s320/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.PNG\" width=\"320\" /></a></div><br /><h2><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">נכון או לא בפרשה?</span></h2></div><div><div style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.3em; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הַמְּצֹרָע נִטְהַר מִיָּד בְּלִי שׁוּם תַּהֲלִיךְ מְיֻחָד?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לטָהֳרַת הַמְּצֹרָע מִשְׁתַּמְּשִׁים בִּשְׁתֵּי צִפּוֹרִים?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אַחַת מהַצִּפּוֹרִים נִשְׁאֶרֶת חַיָּה וּמְשֻׁחְרֶרֶת?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הַמְּצֹרָע טוֹבֵל בְּמַיִם כְּחֵלֶק מִתַּהֲלִיךְ הַטָּהֳרָה?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אַחֲרֵי הַטְּבִילָה הַמְּצֹרָע יָכוֹל מִיָּד לְהִכָּנֵס לְבֵית הַמִּקְדָּשׁ?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בְּפָרָשַׁת מְצֹרָע מֻזְכָּרִים נְגָעִים בַּבְּגָדִים?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בְּפָרָשַׁת מְצֹרָע מֻזְכָּרִים נְגָעִים בַּבָּתִּים?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אִם מוֹפִיעַ נָגַע בַּבַּיִת - שׁוֹבְרִים מִיָּד אֶת כָּל הַבַּיִת?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מוֹצִיאִים אֶת הַחֲפָצִים מֵהַבַּיִת לִפְנֵי בְּדִיקַת הַכֹּהֵן?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מְצֹרָע שֶׁנִּרְפָּא נִשְׁאַר לְבַד כָּל הַחַיִּים?</span></li></ol></div></div>"
}
